  title: Signal on the Ridge
  description: A lookout spots movement on a far ridge and asks whether the caravan can spare supplies for a faster warning run.
  options:
  - label: Send food with the runners
    outcomeText: The warning reaches the next post quickly, but your stores grow thinner.
    resourceEffects:
    - resourceType: 0
      amount: -1
    - resourceType: 1
      amount: 2
  - label: Tip the tower captain in coin
    outcomeText: The captain promises a stronger escort on the next stretch.
    resourceEffects:
    - resourceType: 2
      amount: -1
    - resourceType: 1
      amount: 1
